==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Casaurian Ahirujo]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Lophiiformes Angaburu]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Casaurian Darkjo]] spawns.
**1 [[Winged Pigge]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**1 [[Lophiiformes Angaburu]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
It is advised to stall enemies at the beginning and level up to a full wallet before hitting the base. Once the base is hit, lure the enemies to mid-battlefield and try to kill Winged Pigge as soon as possible with [[:Category:Anti-Angel Cats|anti-Angels]]. The rest is just a matter of patience to slowly kill Darkjo and Angaburu. One way to rush down Winged Pigge would be landing a well timed [[Ototo Corps#Thunderbolt|Thunderbolt Cannon]] to allow [[Food Stall Cat (Rare Cat)|Cafeteria Cat]] or [[Juliet Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Juliet the Maiko]] to permastun her, since this allows [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] can finish the job.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Kalisa (Uber Rare Cat)|Divine Kalisa χ]]: Able to rush and counter Winged Pigge.
*[[Talents|Talented]] [[Lesser Demon Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Greater Balrog Cat]]: Their surprising bulk and Weaken Immunity helps against the Ahirujo , Darkjo and Winged Pigge.

